# react-native-config
# NOTE: .env.dev and .env.github are **committed** (rule 32: dotenv is the android version/app identity source of truth — no secrets inside, API keys live in EncryptedStorage rule 29). Only per-developer overrides belong to *.env.local*
.env.local
.env.*.local

/draft/*

# jenv local JDK pin (machine-local)
.java-version

# debug sandbox mirror (npm run debug:fs)
/.debug-fs/
